{{wikipedia}}
==English==

===Etymology===
From {{MF.}} ''[[dividende]]'', from {{L.}} ''[[dividendum]]''.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{arithmetic}} A number or [[expression]] that is to be divided by another.  Eg. in "42 ÷ 3" the dividend is the 42.
# {{finance}} A [[pro rata]] payment of money by a [[company]] to its [[shareholder]]s, usually made periodically (eg. [[quarterly]] or [[annually]]).

